    "status": "Upcoming",
    "location": "Kishtwar",
    "description": "Kirthai HEP Stage-1 is a run-of-river scheme on river Chenab located at Gulabgarh, Padder in district Kishtwar of J & K and is about 66km from Kishtwar town.",
